  "prefLabel": "Rab 501.01 Purpose",
  "priorExpiration": "2007-09-20",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Rab 501.01 Purpose. The purpose of this chapter is to establish a New Hampshire code of ethics in accordance with RSA 310-B:18-a and Uniform Standards of Professional Appraisal Practice (USPAP) by which all licensed and certified real estate appraisers shall abide.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Rab 100) #5435, eff 7-15-92; ss by #6787, INTERIM, eff 7-15-98, EXPIRED: 11-12-98\n\nNew. #6958, eff 3-23-99, EXPIRED: 3-23-07\n\nNew. #8854, INTERIM, eff 3-24-07, EXPIRED: 9-20-07\n\nNew. #9018, eff 11-1-07; ss by #10270, eff 2-2-13; ss by #13785, eff 12-19-23",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/rab100-500.html"
